msgid ""
"Furnitica is a modern e-commerce platform designed for selling furniture and "
"home décor products. It offers an easy-to-use interface, secure checkout, "
"and a personalized shopping experience. With features like product "
"filtering, customer reviews, and responsive design, Furnitica aims to make "
"online furniture shopping simple, reliable, and enjoyable."
