#: .\templates\pages\about-us.html:48
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                            At Furniture, we create high-"
"quality and stylish furniture designed to bring comfort and elegance into "
"every home. Our team focuses on modern design, durability, and "
"functionality, making sure each piece is crafted with care. From living "
"rooms to bedrooms, we provide furniture that transforms spaces into warm, "
"welcoming, and practical environments.\n"
"                                            "
msgstr ""
"                                            Furniture'da biz har bir uyga qulaylik va "
"elegantlik olib kiruvchi yuqori sifatli va zamonaviy mebellar yaratamiz. "
"Jamoamiz zamonaviy dizayn, mustahkamlik va funksionallikka e'tibor qaratadi, "
"har bir buyumni ehtiyotkorlik bilan ishlab chiqamiz. Mehmonxona va yotoqxona "
"kabi xonalardan tortib, bizning mebellarimiz makonlarni issiq, mehmondo'st va "
"amaliy muhitga aylantiradi.\n"

