"Najot Ta’lim Xadra branch in Tashkent is a modern educational center "
"offering courses in programming, web development, data science, and IT "
"skills. Our experienced instructors provide hands-on training to help "
"students and professionals enhance their technical knowledge and career "
"opportunities. The branch features well-equipped classrooms, a supportive "
"learning environment, and access to the latest software and technologies."
